{"id":"c0dcad490076f68f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-topo8-remote-point.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Remote Point","display":"df-zfc-topo8-remote-point — ZFC Topo8 Remote Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-remote-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-remote-point"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-remote-point — ZFC Topo8 Remote Point","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo10-nowhere-dense-subset.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-remote-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-remote-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-remote-point — ZFC Topo8 Remote Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b8200ebae58c4d\" href=\"?note=71b8200ebae58c4d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3797dce1ae5fa1c3\" href=\"?note=3797dce1ae5fa1c3\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo10-nowhere-dense-subset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo10-nowhere-dense-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e,p,A,C\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e,p,A,C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S\\)</span>（Stone–Čech 紧化谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71b8200ebae58c4d\" href=\"?note=71b8200ebae58c4d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NowhereDenseSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NowhereDenseSubset}_S\\)</span>（无处稠密子集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3797dce1ae5fa1c3\" href=\"?note=3797dce1ae5fa1c3\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo10-nowhere-dense-subset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo10-nowhere-dense-subset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span>（闭包谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8RemotePoint}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8RemotePoint}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}remote\\text{-}point}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8RemotePoint}_S(p,X,\\tau_X,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e;X,\\tau_X)\\land p\\in\\beta X\\setminus e[X]\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\subseteq\\beta X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NowhereDenseSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e[A],C)\\to p\\notin C\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}remote\\text{-}point}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8RemotePoint}_S(p,X,\\tau_X,\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8StoneCechCompactification}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e;X,\\tau_X)\\land p\\in\\beta X\\setminus e[X]\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\subseteq\\beta X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10NowhereDenseSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(\\beta X,\\tau_{\\beta X},e[A],C)\\to p\\notin C\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>远点位于余集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta X\\setminus e[X]\">\\(\\beta X\\setminus e[X]\\)</span>，并避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中每个无处稠密集在紧化中的闭包。</li>\n<li>显式使用嵌入像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e[A]\">\\(e[A]\\)</span>；除非预先把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta X\">\\(\\beta X\\)</span> 的子空间，否则不能直接写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_{\\beta X}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_{\\beta X}(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md","status":"resolved","id":"71b8200ebae58c4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo8-stone-cech-compactification.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-topo10-nowhere-dense-subset.